Package: punto-switcher
Version: @PUNTO_VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @PUNTO_ARCHITECTURE@
Pre-Depends: dpkg (>= 1.20.6)
Depends: @PUNTO_DEPENDS@
Maintainer: Anton Shalin <anton.shalin@gmail.com>
Description: keyboard layout analysis and safe passthrough for Linux
 Punto Switcher monitors keyboard input through interception-tools and analyzes
 text typed with the wrong keyboard layout. Release 2.8.6 runs in a fail-closed
 safety mode that does not dispatch automatic or manual text mutations. The
 package includes a command-line control client. The default artifact includes
 a GTK system-tray client; the explicit daemon-only flavor does not.
